{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"贼风 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"贼风第五十八","date_published":"2025-09-17T14:15:11&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-08-28T07:21:11Z","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-58/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-58/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["贼风"],"summary":"贼风，系指四季气候异常所形成的邪气，俗称外邪。因文中主要讨论外邪侵袭人体所发生的疾病，故称为\u0026quot;贼风\u0026quot;。","content_html":"贼风，系指四季气候异常所形成的邪气，俗称外邪。因文中主要讨论外邪侵袭人体所发生的疾病，故称为\u0026quot;贼风\u0026quot;。"}]}